{"c":[{"name":"20261006T211204Z-63399dc84dfcee60","text":"H14: the rig guest has no Jev, so an Ask gives no page goal; drive attach rows with test hook 'pagetask start <goalProgress>'. The helper echoes no goalAccept: state pageTask.lastAccept* shows what Tab sent.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T211204Z-f2f5d457e6044752","text":"H14: macOS notification banners cover Caret's panels at the screen's top right; a rig click there hits the banner. Give canned page goals a viewport lower down. clickableContent panels take a click only after a mouse move over them.","type":"note"}]}
